; Tabitha, sketch A "Firestorm": A minor, 132 bpm. A proud overdriven-lead hook of rising fourths over straight palm-muted eighth chugs with power-chord hits, fuzz bass in unison and a hat-driven kit. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
